Audit complete: **CONCERNS / LEGIT**.

Both claims reconstructed with fresh definitions and closed with `#Top`; body and false-result mutations failed as expected. Concerns are documented around missing provenance records, opaque `sortVS`, and the binding bridge’s absent universal connection artifact.

